"02.02.01-S013","kind":"main","cn":"我有一个姐姐。","meaning_my":"အစ်မတစ်ယောက် ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S014","kind":"main","cn":"孩子多大了？","meaning_my":"ကလေး အသက်ဘယ်လောက်ရှိပြီလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"五岁了。","meaning_my":"အသက် ငါးနှစ်ရှိပြီ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我跟姐姐一起住。","meaning_my":"အစ်မနဲ့ အတူနေတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我家人不在中国。","meaning_my":"မိသားစုက တရုတ်နိုင်ငံမှာ မရှိဘူး။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S017","kind":"main","cn":"我家孩子五岁了。","meaning_my":"ကလေးက အသက် ငါးနှစ်ရှိပြီ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S018","kind":"main","cn":"我家就我一个孩子。","meaning_my":"မိဘတွေမှာ သားသမီးဆိုလို့ ကိုယ်တစ်ယောက်ပဲ ရှိတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S018_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我是独生子女。","meaning_my":"မိဘတွေရဲ့ တစ်ဦးတည်းသော သားသမီးပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S018_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S019","kind":"main","cn":"我爸妈还在工作。","meaning_my":"အဖေနဲ့အမေ အလုပ်လုပ်နေကြတုန်းပဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S020","kind":"main","cn":"孩子还小。","meaning_my":"ကလေးက ငယ်သေးတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S021","kind":"main","cn":"我妹妹还在上学。","meaning_my":"ညီမက ကျောင်းတက်နေတုန်းပဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你多久回老家一次？","meaning_my":"ဇာတိကို ဘယ်လောက်ကြာကြာ တစ်ခါ ပြန်လဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.01-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.01-S022_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"大概一年回一次。","mean