ning_my":"မိတ်ဆက်ပေးမယ်နော်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S001_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我给你们介绍一下。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်လုံးကို မိတ်ဆက်ပေးမယ်နော်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S001_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S002","kind":"main","cn":"这是我朋友。","meaning_my":"ဒါ သူငယ်ချင်းပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"这位是我朋友。","meaning_my":"ဒါ သူငယ်ချင်းပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S003","kind":"main","cn":"我们是同事。","meaning_my":"အလုပ်ဖော်တွေပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S004","kind":"main","cn":"这是我室友。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အခန်းဖော်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S005","kind":"main","cn":"他是新来的同事。","meaning_my":"သူက အခုမှ အလုပ်ဝင်လာတဲ့ အလုပ်ဖော်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S006","kind":"main","cn":"这是我同事小王。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အလုပ်ဖော် ရှောင်ဝမ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S007","kind":"main","cn":"你们还不认识吧？","meaning_my":"တစ်ယောက်နဲ့တစ်ယောက် မသိကြသေးဘူးမလား။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S007_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"对，我们还不认识。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်တယ်၊ မသိကြသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S007_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S008","kind":"main","cn":"你们以前见过吗？","meaning_my":"အရင်က တွေ့ဖူးကြလား။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S008_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"见过，在上次聚会上。","meaning_my":"တွေ့ဖူးတယ်၊ အရင်တစ်ခါ လူစုတဲ့ပွဲမှာ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S008_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S009","kind":"main","cn":"你们是怎么认识的？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လို သိခဲ့ကြတာလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"以前一起上班认识的。","meaning_my":"အရင် အလုပ်အတူလုပ်ရင်း သိခဲ့တာ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"你们怎么认识的？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်လို သိခဲ့ကြတာလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S010","kind":"main","cn":"你好，我是小李。","meaning_my":"မင်္ဂလာပါ၊ ရှောင်လီပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S011","kind":"main","cn":"第一次见。","meaning_my":"အခုမှ ပထမဆုံး တွေ့တာ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S012","kind":"main","cn":"他是我以前的同事。","meaning_my":"သူက အရင်က အလုပ်ဖော်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S012_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"他以前跟我一起上班。","meaning_my":"သူက အရင်က အလုပ်အတူလုပ်ဖူးတဲ့သူပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S012_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S013","kind":"main","cn":"我们认识很多年了。","meaning_my":"သိကျွမ်းလာတာ နှစ်အများကြီး ရှိပြီ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S014","kind":"main","cn":"我们在一个部门。","meaning_my":"တစ်ဌာနတည်းမှာ အလုပ်လုပ်ကြတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S015","kind":"main","cn":"我们见过吗？","meaning_my":"အရင်က တွေ့ဖူးလား။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S015_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好像见过。","meaning_my":"တွေ့ဖူးသလိုပဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S015_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S016","kind":"main","cn":"这是我的老同学。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အရင်က ကျောင်းနေဖက်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S017","kind":"main","cn":"以后常联系。","meaning_my":"နောက်လည်း အဆက်အသွယ်လုပ်ကြနော်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S017_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"以后多联系。","meaning_my":"နောက်လည်း မကြာခဏ ဆက်သွယ်ကြနော်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S017_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S018","kind":"main","cn":"你们聊，我先过去。","meaning_my":"စကားဆက်ပြောကြနော်၊ အရင် သွားလိုက်ဦးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S019","kind":"main","cn":"我们是大学同学。","meaning_my":"တက္ကသိုလ်တုန်းက အတန်းဖော်တွေပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S020","kind":"main","cn":"这是我房东。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အိမ်ရှင်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S021","kind":"main","cn":"这是我邻居。","meaning_my":"ဒါ အိမ်နီးချင်းပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S021_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"你好，很高兴认识你。","meaning_my":"မင်္ဂလာပါ၊ တွေ့ရတာ ဝမ်းသာပါတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S021_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S022","kind":"main","cn":"你们认识一下吧。","meaning_my":"နှစ်ယောက်လုံး မိတ်ဆက်လိုက်ကြပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S023","kind":"main","cn":"他刚来这边不久。","meaning_my":"သူ ဒီဘက် ရောက်တာ မကြာသေးဘူး။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S024","kind":"main","cn":"有事可以找他。","meaning_my":"ကိစ္စရှိရင် သူ့ကို ဆက်သွယ်လို့ရတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.02-S025","kind":"main","cn":"他中文说得很好。","meaning_my":"သူ တရုတ်စကား ပြောတာ တော်တော်ကောင်းတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.02-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S001","kind":"main","cn":"我该怎么称呼他？","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို ဘယ်လို ခေါ်ရမလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S001.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S001_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"叫他李哥就行。","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို အစ်ကိုလီလို့ပဲ ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S001_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S002","kind":"main","cn":"叫名字就行。","meaning_my":"နာမည်ပဲ ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S002.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S002_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"直接叫我名字吧。","meaning_my":"နာမည်ပဲ တိုက်ရိုက်ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S002_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S003","kind":"main","cn":"请问您是？","meaning_my":"တစ်ဆိတ်လောက်၊ ဘယ်သူပါလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S003.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S003_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我是小李，来找王经理。","meaning_my":"ရှောင်လီပါ၊ ဝမ်မန်နေဂျာနဲ့ လာတွေ့တာပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S003_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S003_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"请问，您是哪位？","meaning_my":"တစ်ဆိတ်လောက်၊ ဘယ်သူပါလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S003_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S004","kind":"main","cn":"李经理在吗？","meaning_my":"လီမန်နေဂျာ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S004_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在，您稍等。","meaning_my":"ရှိပါတယ်၊ ခဏစောင့်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S004_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S005","kind":"main","cn":"不在，刚出去了。","meaning_my":"မရှိဘူး၊ ခုနကပဲ အပြင်ထွက်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S006","kind":"main","cn":"师傅，麻烦一下。","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ နည်းနည်းလောက် ကူညီပါဦး။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S006_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好的，您说。","meaning_my":"ဟုတ်ကဲ့၊ ပြောပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S006_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S006_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"师傅，打扰一下。","meaning_my":"ဆရာ၊ ခဏလောက် နှောင့်ယှက်ပါရစေ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S006_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S007","kind":"main","cn":"老板，这个多少钱？","meaning_my":"ဆိုင်ရှင်ရေ၊ ဒါ ဘယ်လောက်လဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S008","kind":"main","cn":"这是我们经理。","meaning_my":"ဒါ ကျွန်တော်တို့ မန်နေဂျာပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S009","kind":"main","cn":"阿姨，您好。","meaning_my":"အန်တီ၊ မင်္ဂလာပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S010","kind":"main","cn":"找哪位？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်သူနဲ့ တွေ့ချင်တာလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S010_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我找李经理。","meaning_my":"လီမန်နေဂျာကို တွေ့ချင်ပါတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S010_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S010_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"您找谁？","meaning_my":"ဘယ်သူနဲ့ တွေ့ချင်တာလဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S010_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S011","kind":"main","cn":"大哥，麻烦问一下。","meaning_my":"အစ်ကိုကြီး၊ တစ်ခုလောက် မေးပါရစေ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S012","kind":"main","cn":"我能叫您王老师吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာဝမ်လို့ ခေါ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S012_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我叫您王老师可以吗？","meaning_my":"ဆရာဝမ်လို့ ခေါ်လို့ရမလား။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S012_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S013","kind":"main","cn":"王老师好。","meaning_my":"ဆရာဝမ်၊ မင်္ဂလာပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S013.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S014","kind":"main","cn":"张姐在吗？","meaning_my":"ကျန်းအစ်မ ရှိလား။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S014.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S014_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"在，我去叫她。","meaning_my":"ရှိတယ်၊ သွားခေါ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S014_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S015","kind":"main","cn":"大家都叫她张姐。","meaning_my":"အားလုံးက သူ့ကို ကျန်းအစ်မလို့ ခေါ်ကြတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S015.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S016","kind":"main","cn":"我找王师傅。","meaning_my":"ဆရာဝမ်ကို ရှာနေပါတယ်။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S016.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S017","kind":"main","cn":"要我帮你叫他吗？","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို ခေါ်ပေးရမလား။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S017.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S017_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，麻烦你了。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ ကျေးဇူးပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S017_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S018","kind":"main","cn":"你叫他李哥就行。","meaning_my":"လီအစ်ကိုလို့ ခေါ်လိုက်ရုံပါပဲ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S018.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S019","kind":"main","cn":"不用这么客气，叫我小王就行。","meaning_my":"ဒီလောက် မအားနာပါနဲ့၊ ရှောင်ဝမ်လို့ပဲ ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S019.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S019_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"不用这么见外，叫我小王吧。","meaning_my":"ဒီလောက် မအားနာပါနဲ့၊ ရှောင်ဝမ်လို့ပဲ ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S019_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S020","kind":"main","cn":"不用叫我老师。","meaning_my":"ဆရာလို့ ခေါ်စရာ မလိုပါဘူး။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S020.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S021","kind":"main","cn":"他是这家店的老板。","meaning_my":"သူက ဒီဆိုင်ရဲ့ ဆိုင်ရှင်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S021.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S022","kind":"main","cn":"她是新来的主管。","meaning_my":"သူက အခုမှ အလုပ်ဝင်လာတဲ့ ကြီးကြပ်ရေးမှူးပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S022.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S023","kind":"main","cn":"我是他同事。","meaning_my":"သူ့အလုပ်ဖော်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S023.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S024","kind":"main","cn":"他让我来找您。","meaning_my":"သူက ခင်ဗျားဆီ လာတွေ့ခိုင်းလို့ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S024.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.03-S025","kind":"main","cn":"叫他李师傅就行。","meaning_my":"သူ့ကို ဆရာလီလို့ပဲ ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"02.02.03-S025.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"02.02.04-S001","kind":"main","cn":"你家人都好吗？","meaning_my":"မိသားစု အားလုံး နေကောင်းကြလား။","audio_file":"02.02.04-S001.mp3","audio_st